Third-party notes

- The X4 firmware is a patch against CrossPoint Reader 1.4.1
  (https://github.com/crosspoint-reader/crosspoint-reader), which is MIT-licensed.
  When you build the firmware you also obtain CrossPoint under its own license.

- The Anki Desktop add-on runs inside Anki, which is licensed under AGPL-3.0.
  Use of Anki itself remains subject to Anki’s license.
